[
{"id":"mindshub-free-tier","slug":"mindshub-free-tier","name_ar":"MindsHub — طبقة مجانية لـmindshub_air وJev بمفتاح واحد","name_en":"MindsHub — Free Tier for mindshub_air and Jev with One Key","description_ar":"بوابة API موحّدة (api.mindshub.ai) توفر MindsHub Air (الاسم المستعار mindshub_air) وJev من TypeSafe (الاسم المستعار jev) ضمن الطبقة المجانية وبالاستخدام العادل، بلا اشتراك. تُفرض حدود يومية عبر API وتكون استجابة entitlements هي المرجع؛ الأرقام غير منشورة. سياسة الاستخدام العادل الرسمية تقول إن النماذج المشمولة بلا رسوم وبلا بطاقة، وتخصص الطبقة للعمل مع MindsHub Agents أو لوكيل يستدعي API. أهلية العراق غير مذكورة؛ لا توجد حصة رقمية أو مدة ثابتة معلنة.","description_en":"Unified API gateway (api.mindshub.ai) includes MindsHub Air (alias mindshub_air) and TypeSafe’s Jev (alias jev) in its free tier within fair use, with no subscription. Daily limits are enforced through the API and the entitlements response is authoritative; numeric limits are unpublished. The official Fair Use Policy says included models are free with no credit card and describes the tier for work with MindsHub Agents or an agent calling the API. Iraq eligibility is not stated; no numeric quota or fixed duration is published.","category":{"value":"api","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_access","description":{"ar":"mindshub_air وJev مجانًا ضمن الاستخدام العادل، بلا اشتراك أو بطاقة؛ الحدود الرقمية غير منشورة.","en":"mindshub_air and Jev free within fair use, with no subscription or card; numeric limits are unpublished."}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"no","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"بلا اشتراك أو بطاقة؛ حدود يومية يحددها API واستجابة entitlements هي المرجع؛ الأرقام غير منشورة؛ الاستخدام العادل مخصص للعمل مع MindsHub Agents أو وكيل يستدعي API؛ أهلية العراق غير مذكورة.","en":"No subscription or card; daily limits are enforced by the API and entitlements response is authoritative; numeric limits are unpublished; fair use is for work with MindsHub Agents or an agent calling the API; Iraq eligibility is not stated."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"سجل في mindshub.ai وراجع سياسة الاستخدام العادل، ثم أنشئ مفتاح API للبوابة الموحدة.","en":"Sign up at mindshub.ai, review its Fair Use Policy, then create an API key for the unified gateway."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://mindshub.ai/unified-inference","title":"Official MindsHub unified inference page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"mindshub_air and Jev free within fair use, with no subscription or card; numeric limits are unpublished.","evidence":"The page and FAQ state that MindsHub Air (mindshub_air) and Jev (jev) are included in the free tier within fair use, there is no subscription, and daily limits are enforced by the API with entitlements authoritative; no numeric limits are published. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]},{"url":"https://mindshub.ai/fair-use-policy","title":"Official MindsHub Fair Use Policy","claims":[{"field":"eligibility.card_required","value":"no","evidence":"The policy says included models are available at no charge with no credit card required; limits are not published as numbers and the free tier is for work with MindsHub Agents or an agent calling its API. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://mindshub.ai/unified-inference","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة MindsHub الرسمية للاستدلال الموحد","en":"Official MindsHub unified inference page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"تم تصحيح سياسة البطاقة إلى «لا تُطلب» وفق سياسة الاستخدام العادل؛ لا تُنشر حدود رقمية غير متاحة.","en":"Card policy corrected to no card required based on the Fair Use Policy; no unpublished numeric limits are asserted."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"cto-new-free-forever","slug":"cto-new-free-forever","name_ar":"cto.new — خطة Free forever للنماذج الأمامية بلا بطاقة أو مفاتيح API","name_en":"cto.new — Free Forever Plan for Frontier AI Models, No Card or API Keys","description_ar":"خطة Free forever الرسمية تذكر نماذج AI أمامية مجانية، وأعمال AI غير محدودة، ومحادثات وكلاء غير محدودة، وتكاملات API وMCP مجانية؛ ولا تتطلب بطاقة ائتمان أو مفاتيح API. الصفحة لا تسمي النماذج ولا تحدد مقدار الاستخدام أو حدًا يوميًا أو دعمًا بالإعلانات؛ لا تُضاف هذه الشروط من مصادر غير رسمية. أهلية العراق غير مذكورة.","description_en":"The official Free forever plan lists free frontier AI models, unlimited AI Businesses and agent chats, and free API/MCP integrations; it requires no credit card or API keys. The page does not name the models or specify usage amounts, a daily limit, or ad support; those terms are not added from non-official sources. Iraq eligibility is not stated.","category":{"value":"ai-tools","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_access","description":{"ar":"Free forever: نماذج أمامية وأعمال ومحادثات وكلاء غير محدودة وتكاملات API/MCP، بلا بطاقة أو مفاتيح API.","en":"Free forever: frontier models, unlimited AI Businesses and agent chats, API/MCP integrations, no card or API keys."}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"no","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"قائمة النماذج وحدود الاستخدام/الإعلانات غير مفصلة في صفحة التسعير؛ أهلية العراق غير مذكورة رسميًا.","en":"The pricing page does not detail the model list, usage limits or ads; Iraq eligibility is not stated officially."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"ابدأ بالخطة المجانية عبر cto.new.","en":"Start the free plan at cto.new."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://cto.new/pricing","title":"Official cto.new pricing page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"Free forever: frontier models, unlimited AI Businesses and agent chats, API/MCP integrations, no card or API keys.","evidence":"The Free forever plan lists Frontier AI models, unlimited AI Businesses and agent chats, API/MCP integrations, and says no credit card or API keys are required. It does not detail model names or specific usage limits. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://cto.new/pricing","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة تسعير cto.new الرسمية","en":"Official cto.new pricing page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"تأكدت الخطة والميزات ونفي الحاجة إلى البطاقة أو مفاتيح API؛ حُذفت تفاصيل حدود يومية/إعلانات غير موثقة رسميًا.","en":"The plan, features, and no-card/no-API-key statement were confirmed; unsupported daily-limit/ad details were removed."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"stepfun-stepaudio-3-free","slug":"stepfun-stepaudio-3-free","name_ar":"StepFun StepAudio 3 — مجاني حتى 8 نوفمبر 2026 الساعة 18:59:59 بتوقيت بغداد","name_en":"StepFun StepAudio 3 — Free Through Nov 8, 2026 at 18:59:59 Baghdad Time","description_ar":"تظل خدمات سلسلة StepAudio 3 المشمولة مجانية حتى 2026-11-08 23:59:59 بتوقيت UTC+8، أي 2026-11-08 18:59:59 بتوقيت بغداد (UTC+3). يبدأ السعر الجديد في 2026-11-09 00:00 UTC+8، أي 2026-11-08 19:00 بتوقيت بغداد. تشمل القائمة المحادثة الصوتية الفورية وTTS وASR وتوليد الصوت والموسيقى. البطاقة وأهلية العراق غير مذكورتين رسميًا؛ لا تحدد الصفحة حصة مجانية رقمية.","description_en":"Covered StepAudio 3 services remain free through 2026-11-08 23:59:59 UTC+8, i.e. 2026-11-08 18:59:59 Baghdad time (UTC+3). New prices take effect at 2026-11-09 00:00 UTC+8, i.e. 2026-11-08 19:00 Baghdad time. Listed services include real-time voice chat, TTS, ASR, audio generation and music generation. Card and Iraq eligibility are not stated; no numeric free quota is given.","category":{"value":"ai-tools","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_access","description":{"ar":"خدمات StepAudio 3 مجانية حتى 2026-11-08 18:59:59 بتوقيت بغداد؛ تبدأ الفوترة عند 19:00 في اليوم نفسه.","en":"StepAudio 3 services are free through 2026-11-08 18:59:59 Baghdad time; billing begins at 19:00 the same day."}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"unknown","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"انتهاء المجانية 2026-11-08 18:59:59 بغداد؛ تبدأ الأسعار الجديدة 19:00 بغداد (منتصف ليل 9 نوفمبر UTC+8). البطاقة والعراق غير مذكورين رسميًا.","en":"Free access ends 2026-11-08 18:59:59 Baghdad; new prices start 19:00 Baghdad (midnight Nov 9 UTC+8). Card and Iraq are not stated officially."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"promo","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":"2026-11-08","status":"limited"},"steps":{"ar":"استخدم المنصة الدولية platform.stepfun.ai قبل انتهاء نافذة ا