{"id":"cloady-free-tier","slug":"cloady-free-tier","name_ar":"Cloady — طبقة وتجربة مجانيتان لاستضافة التطبيقات وقواعد البيانات بلا بطاقة","name_en":"Cloady — Free Tier and Trial for App and Database Hosting, No Card","description_ar":"منصة Cloady من NeptoLab لاستضافة التطبيقات وقواعد البيانات. تقول الصفحة الرسمية «Free to start, no card needed» وتعرض طبقة مجانية وتجربة مجانية في مناطق محددة. تعرض التجربة المجانية في AUS1 أستراليا وEU1 ألمانيا وIND1 الهند وJPN1 اليابان وUK1 بريطانيا وUSC1 وUSE1 وUSW1؛ وSIN1 سنغافورة غير متاحة حاليًا. الصفحة لا تفصل المناطق المؤهلة للطبقة المجانية عن مناطق التجربة، ولا تحدد مبلغًا أو مدة؛ أهلية العراق غير مذكورة.","description_en":"Cloady by NeptoLab hosts apps and databases. Its official page says “Free to start, no card needed” and offers a free tier and trial in selected regions. It labels AUS1 (Australia), EU1 (Germany), IND1 (India), JPN1 (Japan), UK1, USC1, USE1 and USW1 as Free trial; SIN1 (Singapore) is out of stock. The page does not separately identify free-tier regions or state an amount or duration; Iraq eligibility is not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_access","description":{"ar":"طبقة مجانية وتجربة مجانية بلا بطاقة في مناطق محددة؛ سنغافورة (SIN1) غير متاحة حاليًا.","en":"Free tier and trial, no card, in select regions; Singapore (SIN1) is currently out of stock."}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"no","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"مناطق التجربة المذكورة: AUS1 وEU1 وIND1 وJPN1 وUK1 وUSC1 وUSE1 وUSW1؛ SIN1 نفدت. المناطق الدقيقة للطبقة المجانية والمبلغ والمدة غير محددة؛ العراق غير مذكور.","en":"Trial regions listed: AUS1, EU1, IND1, JPN1, UK1, USC1, USE1 and USW1; SIN1 is out of stock. Exact free-tier regions, amount and duration are not specified; Iraq is not mentioned."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"ابدأ عبر cloady.com واختر منطقة متاحة؛ تحقق من تفاصيل الطبقة المجانية/التجربة عند التسجيل.","en":"Start at cloady.com and choose an available region; confirm the free-tier/trial details during signup."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://cloady.com","title":"Official Cloady homepage","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"Free tier and trial, no card, in select regions; Singapore (SIN1) is currently out of stock.","evidence":"The homepage says “Free to start, no card needed” and offers a free tier or free trial in select regions. It labels AUS1, EU1, IND1, JPN1, UK1, USC1, USE1 and USW1 as Free trial; SIN1 is Out of stock. It does not separately identify free-tier region names, trial duration, or exact free amount. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://cloady.com","type":"official","label":{"ar":"موقع Cloady الرسمي","en":"Official Cloady homepage"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"صُحح تصنيف المناطق: الصفحة تسمي المناطق الثماني «Free trial» ولا تفصل مناطق الطبقة المجانية؛ SIN1 نفدت.","en":"Corrected region classification: the page labels eight regions “Free trial” and does not separately list free-tier regions; SIN1 is out of stock."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"daytona-200-free-compute","slug":"daytona-200-free-compute","name_ar":"Daytona — $200 حوسبة مجانية لصناديق الاختبار الفورية","name_en":"Daytona — $200 Free Compute for Instant Sandboxes","description_ar":"تعرض صفحة تسعير Daytona لصناديق الاختبار الفورية مبلغ $200 من الحوسبة المجانية، مع احتساب الفوترة بالثانية. الصفحة لا تقول إن الرصيد يُمنح عند التسجيل ولا تحدد أهلية أو مدة انتهاء أو سياسة بطاقة؛ تبقى هذه الشروط وأهلية العراق غير معلومة رسميًا.","description_en":"Daytona’s pricing page lists $200 in free compute for Instant Sandboxes and says billing is calculated per second. It does not say the credit is granted on signup or state eligibility, expiry, or card terms; Iraq eligibility is also not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_quota","description":{"ar":"$200 حوسبة مجانية لصناديق الاختبار الفورية؛ الفوترة بالثانية.","en":"$200 free compute for Instant Sandboxes; billing is per second."},"amount":{"unit":"USD","value":200,"currency":"USD"}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"unknown","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"الصفحة لا تربط الرصيد بالتسجيل ولا تذكر أهلية أو تاريخ انتهاء أو سياسة بطاقة؛ أهلية العراق غير مذكورة.","en":"The page does not tie the credit to signup or state eligibility, expiry or card policy; Iraq eligibility is not stated."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"راجع تفاصيل Instant Sandboxes الحالية في daytona.io/pricing قبل الاستخدام.","en":"Review the current Instant Sandboxes terms at daytona.io/pricing before use."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://daytona.io/pricing","title":"Official Daytona pricing page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"$200 free compute for Instant Sandboxes; billing is per second.","evidence":"The Instant Sandboxes section says “$200 in free compute included” and “All billing is calculated per second.” The page does not say that the credit is signup-related or state eligibility, expiry, card, or Iraq terms. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://daytona.io/pricing","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة تسعير Daytona الرسمية","en":"Official Daytona pricing page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"أزيل ادعاء «عند التسجيل» لأنه غير مذكور في صفحة التسعير؛ بقي مبلغ $200 والفوترة بالثانية.","en":"Removed “on signup” because the pricing page does not state that; the $200 amount and per-second billing are verified."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"prized-30-free-credit","slug":"prized-30-free-credit","name_ar":"Prized — رصيد $30 لمرة واحدة لكل شخص لصناديق الاختبار (بلا بطاقة)","name_en":"Prized — $30 One-Time Sandbox Credit per Person (No Card)","description_ar":"توثيق Prized الرسمي يقول إن الرصيد $30 لمرة واحدة لكل شخص وبلا بطاقة؛ كما يوضح أن الحصول عليه مرة لكل صندوق بريد مشروط باجتياز فحوص التسجيل. ضمن الرصيد المجاني: حتى 10 صناديق متزامنة (إجمالي 20 vCPU و40GB)، بحد أقصى 2 vCPU و4GB للصندوق، و60 دقيقة تشغيل إجمالية لكل صندوق، و100GB قرص موزعة على مساحة العمل؛ لا توجد GPUs. بعد الرصيد، يبدأ الشحن من $10 أو يمكن اختيار خطة.","description_en":"Prized’s official docs say the $30 credit is once per person and requires no card; they further qualify access as once per inbox if signup passes Prized’s checks. On free credit alone: up to 10 concurrent sandboxes (20 vCPU and 40 GB total), up to 2 vCPU/4 GB per sandbox, 60 minutes total running time per sandbox, and 100 GB disk across the workspace; no GPUs. After the credit, top-ups start at $10 or a plan can be selected.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_quota","description":{"ar":"$30 رصيد لمرة واحدة لكل شخص/صندوق بريد بعد اجتياز فحوص التسجيل، بلا بطاقة.","en":"$30 one-time credit per person/inbox after signup checks, no card."},"amount":{"unit":"USD","value":30,"currency":"USD"}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"yes","card_required":"no","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"مرة واحدة لكل صندوق بريد بعد اجتياز فحوص التسجيل؛ حتى 10 صناديق متزامنة و60 دقيقة تشغيل لكل صندوق؛ 100GB قرص لكل مساحة عمل؛ لا GPUs؛ العراق غير مذكور.","en":"Once per inbox after signup checks; up to 10 concurrent sandboxes and 60 minutes running per sandbox; 100 GB disk per workspace; no GPUs; Iraq not stated."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"أنشئ حسابًا في prized.dev واجتز فحوص 