{"id":"tensorlake-free-sandbox","slug":"tensorlake-free-sandbox","name_ar":"Tensorlake — طبقة مجانية $0 دائمًا لصندوق اختبار واحد بلا بطاقة","name_en":"Tensorlake — $0 Forever Free Tier for One Sandbox, No Card","description_ar":"خطة Tensorlake Free لصناديق Firecracker microVMs بسعر $0 forever: صندوق واحد في كل مرة بمواصفات 1 vCPU و1GB RAM و10GB قرص، وجلسة حتى ساعتين مع جلسات غير محدودة العدد؛ الأسئلة الشائعة تؤكد عدم الحاجة إلى بطاقة. حزمة Usage Credits المدفوعة تبدأ من $5 وليست شرطًا للطبقة المجانية. أهلية العراق غير مذكورة رسميًا.","description_en":"Tensorlake’s Firecracker microVM Free plan is “$0 forever”: one sandbox at a time with 1 vCPU, 1 GB RAM and 10 GB disk, sessions up to two hours, and unmetered sessions; the FAQ says no credit card is required. The paid Usage Credits pack starts at $5 and is not required for Free. Iraq eligibility is not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_access","description":{"ar":"خطة $0 forever لصندوق واحد (1 vCPU/1GB/10GB)، جلسات حتى ساعتين وغير محدودة العدد، بلا بطاقة.","en":"$0 forever for one sandbox (1 vCPU/1 GB/10 GB), up to 2-hour unmetered sessions, no card."}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"no","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"صندوق واحد في المرة؛ جلسة حتى ساعتين؛ حزمة الرصيد المدفوع تبدأ من $5 وليست مطلوبة للمجاني؛ العراق غير مذكور.","en":"One sandbox at a time; up to 2 hours per session; paid credits start at $5 but are not required for Free; Iraq is not stated."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"سجل في Tensorlake وابدأ بخطة Free دون شراء أرصدة Usage Credits.","en":"Sign up at Tensorlake and start the Free plan without buying Usage Credits."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://www.tensorlake.ai/pricing","title":"Official Tensorlake pricing page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"$0 forever for one sandbox (1 vCPU/1 GB/10 GB), up to 2-hour unmetered sessions, no card.","evidence":"The Free plan is “$0 forever,” one sandbox at a time, 1 vCPU/1 GB RAM/10 GB disk, up to 2 hours per session and unmetered sessions; the FAQ says no credit card is required. The $5 pack belongs to paid Usage Credits. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://www.tensorlake.ai/pricing","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة تسعير Tensorlake الرسمية","en":"Official Tensorlake pricing page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"تأكد أن حد $5 يخص الحزمة المدفوعة فقط، وأن الخطة المجانية لا تتطلب بطاقة.","en":"Confirmed the $5 minimum applies only to paid Usage Credits and that Free requires no card."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"flyio-sprites-30-trial","slug":"flyio-sprites-30-trial","name_ar":"Fly.io Sprites — $30 رصيد تجريبي للمنظمات الجديدة المؤهلة","name_en":"Fly.io Sprites — $30 Trial Credit for Eligible New Organizations","description_ar":"تتضمن Sprites رصيدًا تجريبيًا بقيمة $30 للمنظمات الجديدة المؤهلة؛ لكل مستخدم منحة واحدة ولكل منظمة رصيد واحد كحد أقصى. الفوترة حسب استهلاك CPU والذاكرة والتخزين الفعلي. يجب تأكيد الأهلية عند التسجيل؛ الصفحة لا تحدد مدة الرصيد أو سياسة البطاقة. أهلية العراق غير مذكورة رسميًا.","description_en":"Sprites includes $30 in trial credits for eligible new organizations; each user can grant one credit and each organization can receive at most one. Billing is based on actual CPU, memory and storage consumption. Eligibility must be confirmed at signup; the page does not state the credit duration or card policy. Iraq eligibility is not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_quota","description":{"ar":"$30 رصيد تجريبي لمنظمة جديدة مؤهلة واحدة؛ الفوترة حسب الاستهلاك.","en":"$30 trial credit for one eligible new organization; usage-based billing."},"amount":{"unit":"USD","value":30,"currency":"USD"}}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"yes","card_required":"unknown","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"الأهلية تُؤكد عند التسجيل؛ رصيد واحد لكل منظمة؛ البطاقة ومدة الرصيد والعراق غير مذكورة رسميًا.","en":"Eligibility is confirmed at signup; one credit per organization; card policy, credit duration and Iraq are not stated officially."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"أنشئ منظمة جديدة في Fly.io وتحقق عند التسجيل مما إذا كانت مؤهلة لائتمان Sprites.","en":"Create a new Fly.io organization and confirm at signup whether it qualifies for Sprites trial credit."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://fly.io/learn/sprites-for-ai-agents","title":"Official Fly.io Sprites Learn page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"$30 trial credit for one eligible new organization; usage-based billing.","evidence":"The page says eligible new organizations receive $30 in trial credits; each user can grant one credit and each organization may receive at most one. Usage is billed based on actual resource consumption. The page does not state card, expiry, or Iraq terms for this credit. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://fly.io/learn/sprites-for-ai-agents","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة Fly.io التعليمية الرسمية لـSprites","en":"Official Fly.io Sprites Learn page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"أُبقي قيد «منظمات جديدة مؤهلة»؛ لم يُستنتج أن رصيد Sprites بلا بطاقة من تجربة Fly.io منفصلة.","en":"Kept the eligible-new-organization condition; did not infer the Sprites credit is card-free from a separate Fly.io trial."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"vercel-sandbox-free-hobby","slug":"vercel-sandbox-free-hobby","name_ar":"Vercel Sandbox — حصة Hobby مجانية مع إيقاف الإنشاء 30 يومًا عند تجاوز الحد","name_en":"Vercel Sandbox — Free Hobby Allowance, Creation Pauses for 30 Days at Limit","description_ar":"تتضمن Hobby ($0) شهريًا 5 ساعات CPU نشط، و420 GB-hours ذاكرة، و5,000 إنشاء sandbox، و20GB نقل بيانات؛ حتى 10 صناديق متزامنة وجلسة حتى 45 دقيقة. تقول Vercel إن Sandbox مجاني لمستخدمي Hobby ولا توجد فوترة زائدة؛ عند تجاوز الحصص يتوقف إنشاء الصناديق حتى مرور 30 يومًا على أول استخدام للميزة. خطة Hobby للاستخدام الشخصي غير التجاري فقط. البطاقة وأهلية العراق غير مذكورتين رسميًا.","description_en":"Hobby ($0) includes monthly 5 Active CPU hours, 420 GB-hours memory, 5,000 sandbox creations and 20 GB transfer; up to 10 concurrent sandboxes and 45-minute sessions. Vercel says Sandbox is free for Hobby users with no overage billing; after quota is exceeded, creation pauses until 30 days have passed since first use. Hobby is for personal, non-commercial use only. Card and Iraq eligibility are not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_quota","description":{"ar":"شهريًا: 5 ساعات CPU نشط + 420 GB-hours ذاكرة + 5,000 إنشاء + 20GB نقل؛ بلا فوترة زائدة.","en":"Monthly: 5 Active CPU hours + 420 GB-hours memory + 5,000 creations + 20 GB transfer; no overage billing."},"amount":{"unit":"hours","value":5},"frequency":"monthly"}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"unknown","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"Hobby للاستخدام الشخصي غير التجاري فقط؛ تجاوز الحصة يوقف الإنشاء حتى مرور 30 يومًا من أول استخدام؛ البطاقة والعراق غير مذكورين.","en":"Hobby is personal, non-commercial only; exceeding quotas pauses creation until 30 days after first use; card and Iraq are not stated."}},"pricing":{"currency":"USD","offer_price":0,"billing_cycle":"free","original_price":null},"registration":{"deadline":{"date":null,"status":"ongoing"},"steps":{"ar":"استخدم Sandbox ضمن حصة خطة Vercel Hobby المجانية، وراقب الحدود قبل انتهاء نافذة الـ30 يومًا.","en":"Use Sandbox within Vercel Hobby’s free allowance and monitor quotas before the 30-day window resets."}},"official_sources":[{"url":"https://vercel.com/docs/sandbox/pricing","title":"Official Vercel Sandbox pricing page","claims":[{"field":"benefits.0.description.en","value":"Monthly: 5 Active CPU hours + 420 GB-hours memory + 5,000 creations + 20 GB transfer; no overage billing.","evidence":"The Hobby allowance lists 5 Sandbox Active CPU hours, 420 GB-hours provisioned memory, 5,000 creations and 20 GB data transfer; no additional usage charge is billed. Exceeding quotas pauses creation until 30 days have passed since first use; the page lists 10 concurrent sandboxes and 45-minute sessions. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]},{"url":"https://vercel.com/docs/plans/hobby","title":"Official Vercel Hobby plan documentation","claims":[{"field":"eligibility.conditions.en","value":"Hobby is restricted to non-commercial, personal use only.","evidence":"The Hobby plan is restricted to non-commercial, personal use only. Verified live 2026-11-05."}]}],"get_offer":{"url":"https://vercel.com/docs/sandbox/pricing","type":"official","label":{"ar":"صفحة تسعير Vercel Sandbox الرسمية","en":"Official Vercel Sandbox pricing page"}},"review":{"verdict":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-11-05","notes":{"ar":"أضيف قيد Hobby الشخصي/غير التجاري وسلوك التوقف حتى 30 يومًا من أول استخدام بدل «الدورة التالية» العامة.","en":"Added Hobby’s personal/non-commercial restriction and the exact pause-until-30-days-after-first-use behavior."}},"created_at":null,"status":"active","ends_at":null},
{"id":"freestyle-free-vms","slug":"freestyle-free-vms","name_ar":"Freestyle — حصص شهرية مجانية لآلات VMs بلا فوترة استخدام","name_en":"Freestyle — Monthly Free VM Allowances with No Usage Billing","description_ar":"خطة Free بسعر $0 تضم شهريًا 200 ساعة vCPU و400 GiB-hours ذاكرة و60,000 GiB-hours تخزين و50GB نقل بيانات؛ حتى 10 VMs متزامنة، بحد 4 vCPU و8GiB و32GB قرص لكل VM. تصف Freestyle الحصص بأنها حدود صارمة: لا تستمر إلى فوترة استخدام، وتتوقف الآلات المتأثرة مؤقتًا عند نفاد الحصة حتى إعادة التعيين. عند إضافة بطاقة إلى حساب Free تُخصم $1 للتحقق ثم تُسترد بالكامل؛ الصفحة لا تصرح بأن البطاقة مطلوبة أو غير مطلوبة. أهلية العراق غير مذكورة.","description_en":"The $0 Free plan includes monthly 200 vCPU-hours, 400 GiB-hours memory, 60,000 GiB-hours storage and 50 GB transfer; up to 10 concurrent VMs, with up to 4 vCPU, 8 GiB and 32 GB disk per VM. Freestyle calls the allowances hard limits: usage does not continue into paid overage, and affected VMs pause when a quota is exhausted until reset. Adding a card to a Free account charges $1 for verification and is fully refunded; the page does not explicitly state whether a card is required. Iraq eligibility is not stated.","category":{"value":"cloud","review_status":"verified"},"benefits":[{"type":"free_quota","description":{"ar":"شهريًا: 200 ساعة vCPU + 400 GiB-hours ذاكرة + 60,000 GiB-hours تخزين + 50GB نقل؛ لا فوترة استخدام زائدة.","en":"Monthly: 200 vCPU-hours + 400 GiB-hours memory + 60,000 GiB-hours storage + 50 GB transfer; no usage overage billing."},"amount":{"unit":"vCPU-hours","value":200},"frequency":"monthly"}],"eligibility":{"new_account":"unknown","card_required":"unknown","countries":{"status":"unknown","values":[]},"conditions":{"ar":"الحصص الشهرية حدود صارمة وتتوقف VMs عند النفاد؛ إضافة بطاقة تُخصم $1 للتحقق ثم تُسترد، لكن اشتراط البطاقة غير مصرح به؛ العراق غير مذكور.","en":"Monthly quotas are hard limits and VMs pause when exhausted; adding a card triggers a $1 verification charge that is refunded, but card 